    name: 'cancel',
    endpoint: '/chatkit/sessions/{session_id}/cancel',
    httpMethod: 'post',
    summary: 'Cancel chat session',
    description:
      'Cancel an active ChatKit session and return its most recent metadata.\n\nCancelling prevents new requests from using the issued client secret.',
    stainlessPath: '(resource) beta.chatkit.sessions > (method) cancel',
    qualified: 'client.beta.chatkit.sessions.cancel',
    params: ['session_id: string;'],
    response:
      "{ id: string; chatkit_configuration: { automatic_thread_titling: chat_session_automatic_thread_titling; file_upload: chat_session_file_upload; history: chat_session_history; }; client_secret: string; expires_at: number; max_requests_per_1_minute: number; object: 'chatkit.session'; rate_limits: { max_requests_per_1_minute: number; }; status: 'active' | 'expired' | 'cancelled'; user: string; workflow: { id: string; state_variables: object; tracing: object; version: string; }; }",
    markdown:
      "## cancel\n\n`client.beta.chatkit.sessions.cancel(session_id: string): { id: string; chatkit_configuration: chat_session_chatkit_configuration; client_secret: string; expires_at: number; max_requests_per_1_minute: number; object: 'chatkit.session'; rate_limits: chat_session_rate_limits; status: chat_session_status; user: string; workflow: chatkit_workflow; }`\n\n**post** `/chatkit/sessions/{session_id}/cancel`\n\nCancel an active ChatKit session and return its most recent metadata.\n\nCancelling prevents new requests from using the issued client secret.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `session_id: string`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; chatkit_configuration: { automatic_thread_titling: chat_session_automatic_thread_titling; file_upload: chat_session_file_upload; history: chat_session_history; }; client_secret: string; expires_at: number; max_requests_per_1_minute: number; object: 'chatkit.session'; rate_limits: { max_requests_per_1_minute: number; }; status: 'active' | 'expired' | 'cancelled'; user: string; workflow: { id: string; state_variables: object; tracing: object; version: string; }; }`\n  Represents a ChatKit session and its resolved configuration.\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `chatkit_configuration: { automatic_thread_titling: { enabled: boolean; }; file_upload: { enabled: boolean; max_file_size: number; max_files: number; }; history: { enabled: boolean; recent_threads: number; }; }`\n  - `client_secret: string`\n  - `expires_at: number`\n  - `max_requests_per_1_minute: number`\n  - `object: 'chatkit.session'`\n  - `rate_limits: { max_requests_per_1_minute: number; }`\n  - `status: 'active' | 'expired' | 'cancelled'`\n  - `user: string`\n  - `workflow: { id: string; state_variables: object; tracing: { enabled: boolean; }; version: string; }`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport OpenAI from 'openai-mcp-test';\n\nconst client = new OpenAI();\n\nconst chatSession = await client.beta.chatkit.sessions.cancel('cksess_123');\n\nconsole.log(chatSession);\n```",
