      "## delete\n\n`client.beta.chatkit.threads.delete(thread_id: string): { id: string; deleted: boolean; object: 'chatkit.thread.deleted'; }`\n\n**delete** `/chatkit/threads/{thread_id}`\n\nDelete a ChatKit thread along with its items and stored attachments.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `thread_id: string`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; deleted: boolean; object: 'chatkit.thread.deleted'; }`\n  Confirmation payload returned after deleting a thread.\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `deleted: boolean`\n  - `object: 'chatkit.thread.deleted'`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport OpenAI from 'openai-mcp-test';\n\nconst client = new OpenAI();\n\nconst thread = await client.beta.chatkit.threads.delete('cthr_123');\n\nconsole.log(thread);\n```",
