      "## delete\n\n`client.beta.threads.messages.delete(thread_id: string, message_id: string): { id: string; deleted: boolean; object: 'thread.message.deleted'; }`\n\n**delete** `/threads/{thread_id}/messages/{message_id}`\n\nDeletes a message.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `thread_id: string`\n\n- `message_id: string`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; deleted: boolean; object: 'thread.message.deleted'; }`\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `deleted: boolean`\n  - `object: 'thread.message.deleted'`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport OpenAI from 'openai-mcp-test';\n\nconst client = new OpenAI();\n\nconst messageDeleted = await client.beta.threads.messages.delete('message_id', { thread_id: 'thread_id' });\n\nconsole.log(messageDeleted);\n```",
